    "summary": "Asafo flag with an elephant and palm tree. Basecloth made of yellow silk with rectangles of blue silk in the corners; black cotton border sewn along one side, and red, yellow, blue and white triangles appliquéd around other three sides. Lettered in light blue cursive characters ‘No.III Company Anamaboe’. The central design is an elephant embroidered in brown silk with its trunk round a palm tree, with another tree bent over next to it. In an upper corner is a Union Jack.",
